<https://w3id.org/cdsg/quarantine/validation/legacy-derivation-note> rdfs:comment "Since rc.2 the prov:wasDerivedFrom links of active resources to pre-release identifiers that are not published in any release are kept here for traceability. They were removed from the active graph because those identifiers dereference to nothing."@en .

<https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/alignment/target-3ea24b8d> a ana:TargetCategoryAlignmentAssertion ;
    dcterms:description "Quarantined on 2026-10-12: the Equality Act defines the protected characteristic race, not an ethnic-minority population, so the source does not support an alignment to the curated category."@en ;
    skos:note "Equality Act defines the protected characteristic “race” and its components; it does not define one ethnic-minority population class."@en ;
    ana:alignmentCuratedCategory <https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/uk/ConstitutedPolicyTarget_661ab5c0> ;
    ana:alignmentEvidence <https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/evidence/SourceEvidence_293cfd79> ;
    ana:alignmentRelation <https://w3id.org/cdsg/vocab#target-alignment/needs-review> ;
    ana:alignmentSource <https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/uk/CategoryDefinition_3ea24b8d> .

<https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/alignment/target-d99ed76f> a ana:TargetCategoryAlignmentAssertion ;
    dcterms:description "Quarantined on 2026-10-12: the alignment was already marked invalid-legacy-link; the source statement does not define the curated category."@en ;
    skos:note "SPD-15 defines a federal race/ethnicity classification scheme; it does not define “general public in the United States”."@en ;
    ana:alignmentCuratedCategory <https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/us/ConstitutedPolicyTarget_016b424f> ;
    ana:alignmentEvidence <https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/evidence/SourceEvidence_b5c24c87> ;
    ana:alignmentRelation <https://w3id.org/cdsg/vocab#target-alignment/invalid-legacy-link> ;
    ana:alignmentSource <https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/us/CategoryDefinition_d99ed76f> .

<https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/alignment/target-f229de55> a ana:TargetCategoryAlignmentAssertion ;
    dcterms:description "Quarantined on 2026-10-12: the alignment was already marked invalid-legacy-link; the source statement does not define the curated category."@en ;
